    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Discover world-class customer service  when you rent a two bedroom apartment in the heart of Dublin at Quayside Quarter. This spacious apartment is perfect for renters looking for a new standard of city living. \r\n\r\nOur apartments are beautifully furnished and extend beyond your front door to the numerous amenity spaces such as the onsite gym, residents’ lounge, sky gardens, 24/7 concierge and more. \r\n \r\n796 – 1,076 sq. ft. pet-friendly apartment, Quayside Quarter boast of a range of resident exclusives to help you meet your needs, \r\n\r\n🕒 24/7 Concierge\r\n🏋️‍♂️ Resident Gym\r\n🐶 Pet-friendly development\r\n🔧 24/7 onsite maintenance and management\r\n🏋️‍♂️ Private gym\r\n💼 Co-working spaces\r\n🛋️ Residents lounge\r\n🌇 Communal roof terrace areas\r\n🌱 Sustainable styled living with secure bike storage and electric car charging\r\n🅿️ Parking available by separate negotiation\r\n🧼 Dry Cleaning service\r\n\r\nSitting at the forefront of the Docklands and consisting of 268 premium apartments, Quayside Quarter sets a new standard of rented apartment living in the city. \r\nNot only will residents benefit from a professional service managed by Greystar, but they will also enjoy exceptional quality apartments and access to a host of additional benefits. \r\n\r\nDesigned to refine the work life balance, the Residents' Lounge is an elegant and considered space designed to meet the needs of its residents. With hot desks, meeting spaces and a games area for downtime, it is a space made for collaborators. The private gym is flooded with natural light and features a raw industrial aesthetic.\r\nThe development  draws its inspiration from the fabric of Dublin and the rich industrial heritage of the docklands - infused with contemporary Scandinavian architectural accents and Brooklyn loft-style design.\r\n\r\nMoreover, there are car parking spaces, secure bike storage, a concierge service and landscaped gardens. All apartments are pet friendly and residents can choose from furnished or unfurnished options in an array of floorplans, some with waterfront views.\r\n\r\nProperty features:\r\n•\tProperty Facilities\r\n•\tParking\r\n•\tCentral Heating\r\n•\tCable Television\r\n•\tHotpoint Appliances \r\n•\tDishwasher\r\n•\tMicrowave\r\n•\tPets Allowed\r\n•\tWheelchair Access\r\n•\tInternet\r\n•\tGarden / Patio / Balcony\r\n•\tConcierge\r\n•\tGym\r\n•\tResidents Lounge\r\n•\tCommunity Events\r\n•\tCo-working Space\r\n•\tLaundry\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nConveniently located only 5 minutes away from Docklands rapid rail station (DART) and right next to Spencer Dock light rail station (LUAS). By foot you can reach Point Square in a minute, get to your office at the IFSC in 4 minutes. Dublin airport is just an easy 20-minute taxi away.  The neighbourhood draws its inspiration from the fabric of Dublin and the rich industrial heritage of the docklands - infused with contemporary Scandinavian architectural accents and Brooklyn loft-style design. Providing squares of curated wild landscapes nestle next to bustling streets of restaurants, cafés and stores, anchored by a riverfront boutique hotel creating a vibrant new neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nIf you need contact with a member of the site team, please email team@qquarter.com or call us on 01 5395960\r\n\r\n* Please note that there are multiple property types available at this development. The rent advertised is on these individual property ads represent the starting rent for these property types. \r\n\r\nRent will vary throughout this development depending on different aspects of the property types. Not all the available properties and rents listed here."
      },
